Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: lines

    2 lines: lines NEWLINE stmt
    3      | lines NEWLINE
    4      | stmt
    5      | IMPORT STRING
    6      | ε

    7 stmt: postfix ASSIGN expr
    8     | LET ID ASSIGN expr
    9     | FUNC ID '(' param_list ')' COLON NEWLINE lines END
   10     | FUNC ID '(' ')' COLON NEWLINE lines END
   11     | CLASS ID COLON NEWLINE lines END
   12     | CLASS ID EXTENDS ID COLON NEWLINE lines END
   13     | TRAIT ID COLON NEWLINE lines END
   14     | USE ID
   15     | WHEN condition COLON NEWLINE lines eif_chain otherwise_part END
   16     | WHILE condition COLON NEWLINE lines END
   17     | TRY COLON NEWLINE lines CATCH ID COLON NEWLINE lines END
   18     | THROW expr
   19     | SPAWN postfix '(' opt_arg_list ')'
   20     | SHOW expr_list
   21     | expr

   22 condition: expr

   23 eif_chain: ε
   24          | EIF condition COLON NEWLINE lines eif_chain

   25 otherwise_part: ε
   26               | OTHERWISE COLON NEWLINE lines

   27 expr_list: expr
   28          | expr_list COMMA expr

   29 arg_list: expr_list

   30 opt_arg_list: ε
   31             | arg_list

   32 param_list: ID
   33           | param_list COMMA ID

   34 expr: term
   35     | expr PLUS term
   36     | expr MINUS term
   37     | expr EQ term

   38 term: postfix
   39     | term MUL postfix
   40     | term DIV postfix

   41 postfix: primary
   42        | postfix '.' ID
   43        | postfix '(' opt_arg_list ')'
   44        | postfix '[' expr ']'

   45 primary: ID
   46        | INT_LIT
   47        | STRING
   48        | FLOAT_LIT
   49        | TRUE_KW
   50        | FALSE_KW
   51        | '(' expr ')'
   52        | '[' expr_list ']'
   53        | '[' ']'


